# The build context is the whole monorepo, so every pattern is ** — a bare
# `node_modules` matched the root only, and each build sent every
# submodule's node_modules and .venv (about 1.5 GB) plus their .env files.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.wrangler
**/media
**/staticfiles_build
**/db.sqlite3
**/.env
**/.dev.vars
**/.idea
**/.pytest_cache
.claude
Claude outputs
